### Election Day

[2026 General Election](https://elections.clintoncounty-ia.gov/elections/info/2026_general_election_2026_11_03/)

## Welcome to the Clinton County, Iowa, Elections Website

 The Election Department in the [Auditor’s Office](https://www.clintoncounty-ia.gov/AuditorElections) is responsible for every aspect of conducting an election from voter registration to the final count of the votes. This site is designed to be a resource for residents looking to learn [how to vote](https://elections.clintoncounty-ia.gov/vote/), find their [elected officials](https://elections.clintoncounty-ia.gov/elected_officials/), learn about becoming a [candidate](https://elections.clintoncounty-ia.gov/candidates/), or find [past](https://elections.clintoncounty-ia.gov/elections/past) or [upcoming](https://elections.clintoncounty-ia.gov/elections/) election information. 

